      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "j_bot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 712,
      "y": 490,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "box bottom  29240.00\n= 08-20's value low",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "j_boxl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 712,
      "y": 340,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "the JBA box —\nthe rectangle drawn\non your chart that day",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "j_n1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 225,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "overlaps 08-19\nby 8.75 pts, but\nthe drawn box\nstops below it",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "j_n2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 300,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "08-20 and 08-19 never touch (2-pt gap) —\n08-21 bridges them",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "j_c1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "j_c1t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 912,
      "y": 140,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"When we have overlapping\npivots -- and I use a 5-day\nlookback ... anything within\na 5-day lookback that is\noverlapping like this is going\nto grant me a box of the\nauction. It's going to be\nrolling and moving forward.\"\n— DD @30:16",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "j_c2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 180,
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "j_c2t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 912,
      "y": 370,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Because the window rolls,\nthe box recomputes daily.\nThat is all \"expand\",\n\"shift\" and \"branch\" mean.\n\nAnd it is a value zone:\ntraverse it, play the\nedges, nothing in the\nmiddle.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:22:56.720Z",
      "version": 1
    }
  ],
